  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Market development in the DRC &#x2013; Testing new and innovative interventions in agriculture, renewable energy and finance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Market development in the DRC &#x2013; Testing new and innovative interventions in agriculture, renewable energy and finance is a component of Private Sector Development programme in the Democratic Republic of Congo reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xA3;5,690,185. It works in the following sector(s): Informal/semi-formal financial intermediaries, Agricultural services, Power generation/renewable sources, Small and medium-sized enterprises (SME) development.</narrative>
  </description>
